Origins
-------

omni was forked from Herdr at version 0.6.4. The Git tag `omni-fork-point`
marks the last upstream commit that omni inherits. All commits made on top
of that tag in this repository are omni-specific modifications by the omni
authors. Full upstream history is preserved in this repository in keeping
with AGPL §5(a), which requires "prominent notices stating that you modified
[the work], and giving a relevant date."

